{"frases": [{"a": 0, "b": 3.9830000000000005, "t": "One joke destroyed a company: an empire with over a thousand stores.", "k": ["destroyed"], "w": [0.056, 0.287, 0.572, 1.133, 1.253, 1.786, 1.962, 2.357, 2.643, 2.929, 3.049, 3.555]}, {"a": 3.9830000000000005, "b": 6.586, "t": "But the joke isn't even the worst part.", "k": ["isn't"], "w": [4.033, 4.263, 4.494, 4.78, 5.065, 5.351, 5.581, 5.922]}, {"a": 6.586, "b": 7.633, "t": "In 1991,", "k": ["1991,"], "w": [6.636, 6.822]}, {"a": 7.633, "b": 11.956, "t": "Gerald Ratner ran a jewelry chain his family had built in Britain.", "k": ["Britain."], "w": [7.683, 8.102, 8.521, 8.765, 8.893, 9.37, 9.731, 9.976, 10.394, 10.639, 10.999, 11.186]}, {"a": 11.956, "b": 14.606, "t": "Its jewelry was cheap, and people loved it.", "k": ["jewelry"], "w": [12.006, 12.222, 12.643, 12.859, 13.254, 13.47, 13.84, 14.159]}, {"a": 14.606, "b": 18.686, "t": "That April, he gave a speech to thousands of business leaders in London.", "k": ["thousands"], "w": [14.656, 14.916, 15.3, 15.46, 15.719, 15.829, 16.189, 16.348, 16.858, 17.017, 17.477, 17.886, 18.046]}, {"a": 18.686, "b": 22.939999999999998, "t": "He joked that he could sell a set of drinking glasses so cheap because it was,", "k": ["drinking"], "w": [18.736, 18.901, 19.22, 19.487, 19.652, 19.97, 20.238, 20.351, 20.567, 20.732, 21.205, 21.627, 21.791, 22.11, 22.532, 22.697]}, {"a": 22.939999999999998, "b": 24.636, "t": "in his words, total crap.", "k": ["words,"], "w": [22.99, 23.154, 23.37, 23.766, 24.085]}, {"a": 24.636, "b": 27.22, "t": "Then he said his earrings cost less than a sandwich,", "k": ["sandwich,"], "w": [24.686, 24.928, 25.077, 25.319, 25.515, 25.943, 26.185, 26.427, 26.669, 26.772]}, {"a": 27.22, "b": 28.846, "t": "and wouldn't last as long.", "k": ["wouldn't"], "w": [27.27, 27.465, 27.847, 28.089, 28.238]}, {"a": 28.846, "b": 32.446000000000005, "t": "Now the worst part, the one that turned a joke into a disaster.", "k": ["disaster."], "w": [28.896, 29.098, 29.3, 29.599, 29.921, 30.123, 30.326, 30.576, 30.923, 31.028, 31.279, 31.529, 31.635]}, {"a": 32.446000000000005, "b": 35.476000000000006, "t": "He had told that joke before, and nothing had happened.", "k": ["happened."], "w": [32.496, 32.646, 32.844, 33.088, 33.333, 33.577, 33.986, 34.184, 34.569, 34.767]}, {"a": 35.476000000000006, "b": 37.692, "t": "But this time, the newspapers picked it up.", "k": ["newspapers"], "w": [35.526, 35.726, 35.973, 36.291, 36.491, 37.024, 37.366, 37.518]}, {"a": 37.692, "b": 41.176, "t": "And his customers read that he was laughing at what they bought.", "k": ["customers"], "w": [37.742, 37.941, 38.141, 38.626, 38.873, 39.12, 39.273, 39.472, 39.91, 40.062, 40.309, 40.556]}, {"a": 41.176, "b": 42.366, "t": "They stopped coming.", "k": ["stopped"], "w": [41.226, 41.506, 41.948]}, {"a": 42.366, "b": 46.376000000000005, "t": "About 500 million pounds of the company's value disappeared.", "k": ["500", "pounds"], "w": [42.416, 42.75, 43.375, 43.816, 44.204, 44.377, 44.603, 45.098, 45.432]}, {"a": 46.376000000000005, "b": 49.126000000000005, "t": "Eighteen months later, he was out of the business.", "k": ["business."], "w": [46.426, 46.852, 47.186, 47.543, 47.692, 47.886, 48.081, 48.229, 48.424]}, {"a": 49.126000000000005, "b": 52.155, "t": "Lesson: never joke about the quality of what you sell.", "k": ["Lesson:"], "w": [49.176, 49.63, 49.954, 50.226, 50.55, 50.769, 51.197, 51.364, 51.636, 51.855]}, {"a": 52.155, "b": 54.846000000000004, "t": "Your customers might be listening one day.", "k": ["customers"], "w": [52.205, 52.477, 53.009, 53.333, 53.5, 54.033, 54.252]}, {"a": 54.846000000000004, "b": 57.589000000000006, "t": "Tell me if you'd keep buying from a brand after that.", "k": ["buying"], "w": [54.896, 55.152, 55.31, 55.467, 55.723, 55.98, 56.334, 56.59, 56.699, 57.004, 57.309]}, {"a": 57.589000000000006, "b": 61.45, "t": "Follow for the next million dollar mistake.", "k": ["mistake."], "w": [57.639, 57.994, 58.201, 58.408, 58.664, 59.068, 59.4